<title>USA: Mo. $49.9 mln housing bonds yield 7.45 pct in 2027.</title>
<headline>Mo. $49.9 mln housing bonds yield 7.45 pct in 2027.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
